  <!-- EN: Dragonbane Bite -->
  <EGO_Trophy_Dragonbane_A.label>屠龙之噬</EGO_Trophy_Dragonbane_A.label>
  <!-- EN: Dr. Alexander Isaacs never intended to slay dragons—only to understand them. Yet, in the depths of his relentless experiments, something unnatural took shape. A weapon born not of craftsmanship, but of twisted science and forgotten wills, thirsting for the very essence it was made to destroy.\n\nGestated Amalgam weapon charged with Cryo and Acid damages.\n\nKnife born from an unholy fusion, carrying the potential to evolve further. -->
  <EGO_Trophy_Dragonbane_A.description>亚历山大·艾萨克斯博士从未打算杀死巨龙——他只想了解它们。然而，在他不懈的实验深处，某种不自然的东西成形了。这把武器并非诞生于工艺，而是源于扭曲的科学和被遗忘的意志，渴望着它被创造出来要毁灭的本质。\n\n孕育出的融合武器，带有冷冻和酸蚀伤害。\n\n由邪恶融合诞生的匕首，具有进一步进化的能力。</EGO_Trophy_Dragonbane_A.description>
